      "mergedPostDetails": "A player leaving the world is a valid case of ownership for a networked object changing, and should thus trigger OnOwnershipTransferred as a result.  This feels like either a bug or an odd design choice to make, as it's an esoteric case that should be standardize by this endpoint.",
