      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "This should be fixed in version 2023.2.1, build 1295! 🎉\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jPsqMUKrI_M\n\n`OnOwnershipTransferred` now fires when master client leaves\n\nPlease let us know if you continue experiencing any issues. Thank you for your report, we appreciate your help!",
